Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sln
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.suo

__pycache__/

# Build output left on older checkouts by the removed capture host and vendored MindAttic.Capture (US-T693).
Capture/**/bin/
Capture/**/obj/
Vendor/**/bin/
Vendor/**/obj/

# Packaged games (tools/package.ps1).
Builds/
# Written by the cooker on every package.
**/Build/Windows/FileOpenOrder/

# Third-party art packs from the owner's libraries (US-T109): their licences forbid redistributing them, so neither
# the source files nor the imported assets are committed. tools/import-*.ps1 rebuilds them; see docs/ThirdPartyArt.md.
# That covers every pack: StarSparrow (US-T109), USC, Ultimate Spaceships Creator (US-T142), SSC, Space Station
# Creator (US-T143), and any added later.
Cpp/SourceArt/ThirdParty/
Cpp/Content/ThirdParty/
# US-T458: the Manalith's prepared pieces (tools/import-manalith.ps1 rebuilds them); its imported assets are committed.
Cpp/SourceArt/Manalith/
# US-T452: sg.ExportVehicles' meshes of the kits' ships and stations (their geometry, for SpaceGod.Studio): local only.
Data/Vehicles/Meshes/Kit/
Cpp/Content/ThirdParty/USC/
Cpp/Content/ThirdParty/SSC/

# US-T586: Piper (piper.exe, its DLLs, espeak-ng-data) and its .onnx voices; tools/fetch-piper.ps1 fetches them.
Vendor/Piper/

# US-T171/US-T236: the Prose conduit (docs/PROSE.md). The universe file is rebuilt from Core and a seed by the mapper
# (tools/universe-export.ps1); the consumer kit's pending texts, Outbox journal and scratch are local. Committed: the
# kit config, applied.jsonl and the applied texts under Data/Lore.
Data/Prose/*.json
!Data/Prose/prose.config.json
Data/Prose/*.universe.json
Data/Prose/pending/
Data/Prose/outbox.jsonl
Data/Prose/.kit/
# Left by the retired tools/prose-sync.ps1 and tools/prose-outbox.ps1 (US-T171), kept ignored on older checkouts.
Data/Lore/.outbox/
Data/Prose/*.import-batches/
